<p><strong>Bottom line</strong>: Localization means delivering the "right ad" to the "right people," not delivering the "same ad" to "people who speak different languages." In Southeast Asia and LatAm markets, spending 1-2 extra days on localization checks can often save 30%+ in wasted spend.</p>
